<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia October inflation up to 9.7 percent y/y.</title>
<headline>Slovenia October inflation up to 9.7 percent y/y.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovenia's Statistical Office reported the following economic indicator details on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    SLOVENIAN INFLATION		   Oct	 Sept   Oct '95</p>
<p>Monthly consumer price rise (pct)     0.8	 0.5	0.6</p>
<p>Yr/yr rise (pct)			    9.7	 9.4	9.3 --</p>
<p>-- Novica Mihajlovic, Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
